RAF STREAM — third-party components
====================================

This repository bundles components from DJI-Link (Apache License 2.0):

- stb/aoa_device.py, stb/raw_gadget.py, stb/bridge.py — verbatim copies
  from the DJI-Link Pi beta source tree (USB gadget / AOA device-side
  implementation).
- stb/bin/dji-bridge, stb/bin/dji-netctl — prebuilt aarch64 binaries from
  the DJI-Link release (dji-link-pi.tar.gz).
- stb/pi_src/ — C++ sources for rebuilding those binaries.

